  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you use your Action Surge, you attune yourself to the Shadowfell for 1 minute or until you have the Incapacitated condition. For the duration, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Shade Form.</strong> When an attack roll hits you, you can take a Reaction to become insubstantial for a moment and reduce the attack's total damage against you to 0.</p><p><strong>Unwavering Resolve.</strong> You have Immunity to the Charmed and Frightened conditions. If you are Charmed or Frightened when you activate your Grieving Mantle, the condition ends on you.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
